whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah (1.0+git20170414-0ddebs11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches/04_enable-vsync-desktop-fullscreen.patch : enable V-
    Sync (SDL_GL_SetSwapInterval after context creation) and start
    fullscreen at the desktop resolution instead of switching the screen
    to 1280x720
  * debian/patches/03_add-fullscreen-resize.patch : DEP-3 header fixed
    (Assisted-By, Forwarded)
  * debian/resources/whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah.png : real 256x256 icon
    (was an empty file), cropped from the upstream screenshot
  * debian/whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah.install : use dh-exec to rename the
    executable, instead of mv in debian/rules
  * debian/rules : removed redundant -DUSE_LD (already defined by
    CMakeLists.txt)
  * debian/control : improved description
  * debian/resources/whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah.desktop : added Keywords
  * debian/whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah.6.md : documented fullscreen, V-
    Sync and resolution options, fixed --option rendering
  * debian/whiskyinatube-by-faemiyah.lintian-overrides : override pandoc
    groff-message false positive

